<DIV class="NewsDay">
    	<SCRIPT type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript1.1"><!--
	Headline('2001-03-10th','../images/headline');
	//--></SCRIPT>
	<H3>Plane of Air (<A href="signup.php3?Event=sky-2001-03-10">Signup for this raid</A>)</H3>
	<P>	<table cellspacing="2" cellpadding="2" border="0">
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Eventtype:</b></td><td>Raid to plane of Air (first time!)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Date:</b></td><td>Saturday, March 10th 2001</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Time:</b></td><td>11am Eastern (8am Pacific, 5pm Central Europe)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Duration:</b></td><td>Approx. 16 hours</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Location:</b></td><td>Plane of Air</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Meeting&nbsp;place:</b></td><td>Lesser Faydark one hour (10am EST) before the raid begins (On the zone to greater faydark)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Level:</b></td><td>Level 49+ (this is the first time so we should try to have 49+ but 47+ works too)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Map:</b></td><td><A href="http://www.eqmaps.com/mapz/airplane2.gif" target="_blank">EQMaps Plane of Air map</A></td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Zoneinfo:</b></td><td><A href="http://www.eqmaps.com/zone.php3?tag=airplane" target="_blank">EQMaps Plane of Air info</A></td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Guide:</b></td><td><A href="http://www.glaznor.org/guides/planeofair" target="_blank">Nedd's Guide to Plane of Sky</A></td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Roster:</b></td><td>01&nbsp;-&nbsp;Utrellien&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Paladin) (M)<BR>
02&nbsp;-&nbsp;Ratinga&nbsp;(55&nbsp;Wizard) (M)<BR>
03&nbsp;-&nbsp;Nedd&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Warrior) (M)<BR>
04&nbsp;-&nbsp;kelval&nbsp;(54&nbsp;Cleric) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>05&nbsp;-&nbsp;Traak&nbsp;(50&nbsp;Ranger) (M)</SPAN><BR>
06&nbsp;-&nbsp;Fobben&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Druid) (M)<BR>
07&nbsp;-&nbsp;Sandory&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Warrior) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>08&nbsp;-&nbsp;Nenamien&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Ranger) (M)</SPAN><BR>
09&nbsp;-&nbsp;Briladven&nbsp;(54&nbsp;Necromancer) (M)<BR>
10&nbsp;-&nbsp;Hamalek&nbsp;(56&nbsp;Warrior) (M)<BR>
11&nbsp;-&nbsp;Shalimar&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Wizard) (M)<BR>
12&nbsp;-&nbsp;Valerose&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Druid) (M)<BR>
13&nbsp;-&nbsp;Darkded&nbsp;(53&nbsp;Necromancer) (M)<BR>
14&nbsp;-&nbsp;Creeping&nbsp;(50&nbsp;Warrior) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>15&nbsp;-&nbsp;Siobahn&nbsp;(53&nbsp;Wizard) (M)</SPAN><BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>16&nbsp;-&nbsp;Kelsore&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Cleric) (M)</SPAN><BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>17&nbsp;-&nbsp;Destitute&nbsp;(46&nbsp;Warrior) (M)</SPAN><BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>18&nbsp;-&nbsp;Kenar&nbsp;(48&nbsp;Cleric) (M)</SPAN><BR>
19&nbsp;-&nbsp;Oimelc&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Enchanter) (M)<BR>
20&nbsp;-&nbsp;Couladin&nbsp;(55&nbsp;Bard) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>21&nbsp;-&nbsp;Snowfox&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Shaman) (M)</SPAN><BR>
22&nbsp;-&nbsp;Nalthek&nbsp;(49&nbsp;Necromancer) (M)<BR>
23&nbsp;-&nbsp;Shadowbow&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Ranger) (M)<BR>
24&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tolstoy&nbsp;(58&nbsp;Warrior) (I)<BR>
25&nbsp;-&nbsp;Rykar&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Ranger) (I)<BR>
26&nbsp;-&nbsp;Arsenic&nbsp;(60&nbsp;Shadow Knight) (I)<BR>
27&nbsp;-&nbsp;Lumpin&nbsp;(55&nbsp;Rogue) (I)<BR>
28&nbsp;-&nbsp;Elicia&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Enchanter) (I)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>29&nbsp;-&nbsp;Anatheme&nbsp;(55&nbsp;Magican) (I)</SPAN><BR>
30&nbsp;-&nbsp;Natallia&nbsp;(50&nbsp;Warrior) (I)<BR>
31&nbsp;-&nbsp;Vodalion&nbsp;(49&nbsp;Enchanter) (U)<BR>
32&nbsp;-&nbsp;Quinstar&nbsp;(54&nbsp;Enchanter) (U)<BR>
</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Description:</b></td><td>
		    This is our first trip to the Plane of Air. Since we do not know much what we will found there the restrictions
		    on invited guests and levels are a bit harder than in our other raids.<BR><BR>
		    We will try to have all who are coming at least level 49+. However some 47+ will work but we should better go with
		    most at 50+. Invited guests has to be wellknown by the Souls. So only a limited amount of invited guests can go
		    those who we are sure will work perfectly with us.<BR><BR>
		    More informations on this topic will be available soon maybe so please check here and the messageboard.
		</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	</P>
</DIV>

<DIV class="NewsDay">
    	<SCRIPT type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript1.1"><!--
	Headline('2001-03-22nd','../images/headline');
	//--></SCRIPT>
	<H3>Plane of Fear (<A href="signup.php3?Event=fear-2001-03-22">Signup for this raid</A>)</H3>
	<P>	<table cellspacing="2" cellpadding="2" border="0">
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Eventtype:</b></td><td>Raid to plane of Fear (first time!)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Date:</b></td><td>Thursday, March 22nd 2001</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Time:</b></td><td>2pm Eastern (11am Pacific, 8pm Central Europe)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Duration:</b></td><td>Approx. 10 hours (maximum 16h)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Location:</b></td><td>Plane of Fear</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Meeting&nbsp;place:</b></td><td>Ferrot on the Feargate one hour (1pm EST) before the raid begins.</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Level:</b></td><td>Levels 47+ (Level 46+ if you have at least half of your exp bar full)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Map:</b></td><td><A href="http://www.glaznor.com/fear/fearmap.jpg" target="_blank">Fear map with run in path (red line)</A></td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Zoneinfo:</b></td><td><A href="http://www.eqmaps.com/zone.php3?tag=fearplane" target="_blank">EQMaps Plane of Fear info</A></td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Roster:</b></td><td>01&nbsp;-&nbsp;Utrellien&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Paladin) (M)<BR>
02&nbsp;-&nbsp;Bruto&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Monk) (M)<BR>
03&nbsp;-&nbsp;kelval&nbsp;(54&nbsp;Cleric) (M)<BR>
04&nbsp;-&nbsp;Fobben*&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Druid) (M)<BR>
05&nbsp;-&nbsp;Sandory&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Warrior) (M)<BR>
06&nbsp;-&nbsp;Nenamien&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Ranger) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>07&nbsp;-&nbsp;Asdrubael&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Shadow Knight) (M)</SPAN><BR>
08&nbsp;-&nbsp;Briladven&nbsp;(54&nbsp;Necromancer) (M)<BR>
09&nbsp;-&nbsp;Hamalek&nbsp;(56&nbsp;Warrior) (M)<BR>
10&nbsp;-&nbsp;Nune&nbsp;(54&nbsp;Druid) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>11&nbsp;-&nbsp;Katholicon&nbsp;(50&nbsp;Cleric) (M)</SPAN><BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>12&nbsp;-&nbsp;Elanna&nbsp;(41&nbsp;Bard) (M)</SPAN><BR>
13&nbsp;-&nbsp;Solos&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Druid) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>14&nbsp;-&nbsp;Traak&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Ranger) (M)</SPAN><BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>15&nbsp;-&nbsp;Kenar&nbsp;(50&nbsp;Cleric) (M)</SPAN><BR>
16&nbsp;-&nbsp;Efrieum&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Warrior) (M)<BR>
17&nbsp;-&nbsp;Nedd&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Warrior) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>18&nbsp;-&nbsp;Eviless&nbsp;(49&nbsp;Shadow Knight) (M)</SPAN><BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>19&nbsp;-&nbsp;Kelsore&nbsp;(53&nbsp;Cleric) (M)</SPAN><BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>20&nbsp;-&nbsp;Snowfox&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Shaman) (M)</SPAN><BR>
21&nbsp;-&nbsp;Gart&nbsp;(55&nbsp;Shaman) (M)<BR>
22&nbsp;-&nbsp;Siglo&nbsp;(56&nbsp;Shaman) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>23&nbsp;-&nbsp;Bety&nbsp;(47&nbsp;Cleric) (M)</SPAN><BR>
24&nbsp;-&nbsp;Shadowbow&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Ranger) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>25&nbsp;-&nbsp;Kantia&nbsp;(49&nbsp;Enchanter) (M)</SPAN><BR>
26&nbsp;-&nbsp;KurgLongshanks&nbsp;(53&nbsp;Shaman) (M)<BR>
27&nbsp;-&nbsp;NalthekKanan&nbsp;(49&nbsp;Necromancer) (M)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>28&nbsp;-&nbsp;Sheqessa&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Ranger) (I)</SPAN><BR>
29&nbsp;-&nbsp;Tolstoy&nbsp;(58&nbsp;Warrior) (I)<BR>
30&nbsp;-&nbsp;Lancafogo&nbsp;(51&nbsp;Wizard) (I)<BR>
31&nbsp;-&nbsp;Rendlin&nbsp;(54&nbsp;Druid) (I)<BR>
32&nbsp;-&nbsp;Rykar&nbsp;(52&nbsp;Ranger) (I)<BR>
<SPAN style='color:red'>33&nbsp;-&nbsp;Quinstar&nbsp;(54&nbsp;Enchanter) (U)</SPAN><BR>
</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Description:</b></td><td>
		    Another Plane of Fear raid from the Souls. This one is again in the week. So we try to alternate
		    the weekend and weekly raids (hate and fear). Next Plane of Hate will be on a weekend than.<BR><BR>
		    The limitation for the raid is like allways 24 ppl all at level 47+. Only if you have enough
		    exp in level 46 (arround half a bar) you should and can go as well.<BR><BR>
		    Invited guests can only go if there is enough room after the Souls has signed up.
		</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	</P>
</DIV>

<DIV class="NewsDay">
    	<SCRIPT type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript1.1"><!--
	Headline('2001-05-04th','../images/headline');
	//--></SCRIPT>
	<H3>Plane of Hate <!-- (<A href="signup.php3?Event=hate-2001-05-04">Signup for this raid</A>) --></H3>
	<P>	<table cellspacing="2" cellpadding="2" border="0">
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Eventtype:</b></td><td>Raid to plane of Hate</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Date:</b></td><td>Friday, May 04th 2001</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Time:</b></td><td>4pm Eastern (1pm Pacific, 10pm Central Europe)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Duration:</b></td><td>Approx. 10 hours (maximum 16h)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Location:</b></td><td>Plane of Hate</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Meeting&nbsp;place:</b></td><td>Lesser Faydark one hour (3pm EST) before the raid begins (On the zone to greater faydark)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Level:</b></td><td>Levels 47+ (46 maybe depends on the exp in this level)</td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Map:</b></td><td><A href="http://www.glaznor.com/hate/hatemap.gif" target="_blank">Plane of Hate LSoG Map</A></td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Zoneinfo:</b></td><td><A href="http://www.eqmaps.com/zone.php3?tag=hateplane" target="_blank">EQMaps Plane of Hate info</A></td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Roster:</b></td><td></td></tr>
		<tr valign="top"><td width="120"><b>Description:</b></td><td>
			Raid to the plane of Hate. This time the raid will be limited to 24 people who can go. Also it is in general only
			for the members of the Lost Souls of Glaznor. More information will be available soon with a newly created guide
			and other informations.<BR><BR>
			The signup for this raid will be available appox 3 weeks before the raid takes place. Make sure you visit the page
			in time again to sign up for the raid.
<!--			Press the link above to signup for this raid. Only members or invited guests should signup here and if you didn't
			signed up you may can't go to this raid. -->
		</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	</P>
</DIV>

</DIV>

